<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29467" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mollesco</span></b> , ĕre, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. inch. n.</i>
			[molleo], <i>to become soft, to soften</i> (<b>poet.</b> and in post-Aug. prose; cf. liquesco).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rura colit nemo: mollescunt colla juvencis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cat.
					64, 38</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ebur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 10, 283</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tactu,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					12, 17, 37, § 76</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>To become soft, mild</i>, or <i>gentle</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tum genus humanum primum mollescere coepit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					5, 1014</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pectora,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. P.
					1, 6, 8</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>To become effeminate, unmanly</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mollescat in undis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					4, 386</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ne forte mollescat cor vestrum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Jer. 51, 46</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
